This repository contains no third-party source code. At analysis time it imports, from a clone kept
outside the repository, NVIDIA's Ising-Decoding code (github.com/NVIDIA/Ising-Decoding, Apache
License 2.0): MemoryCircuit and NoiseModel, used to reproduce NVIDIA's reference decoding graphs.
No NVIDIA model weights are downloaded or used.

It invokes GraphCrunch (github.com/vaibh-pra/GraphCrunch, MIT License, Copyright 2026 Vaibhav N.
Prakash) as an external tool, built against nauty (Brendan McKay and Adolfo Piperno, Apache License
2.0), both outside the repository. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
